; The four below are places rather than built things: nothing stands at any of
; them yet, and the marker is the whole of what is there. Their directions come
; from dev/_waypoint_sites.gd, which searched the height field for ground that
; is dry, out of the ice cap and low enough to be the coast it is called — the
; exact pole and the exact antipode both land in water.

; The far side, at the antipode of the spawn markers, so it is the one place the
; planet always hides: the marker for it is only ever drawn from orbit.
